{'symbol': 'SYK', 'date': '2022-02-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'STRYKER DECLARES A $0.695 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'KALAMAZOO, MICHIGAN, FEB. 02, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STRYKER (NYSE:SYK) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.695 PER SHARE PAYABLE APRIL 29, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MARCH 31, 2022, REPRESENTING AN INCREASE OF 10.3% VERSUS THE PRIOR YEAR AND UNCHANGED FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER.'}